# Everything under vendor/brotli/ is downloaded by build.d::buildBrotli
# from the upstream tarball. Only the ImportC bridge (`brotli_api.c`)
# and this .gitignore stay in version control.
#
# Headers are read directly from `vendor/brotli/src/c/include/brotli/`
# (the extracted tarball) — dub's cImportPath points there, not at a
# separate in-tree snapshot. Eliminates the header-drift bug class
# that earlier audit caught (mirror step ran only on first build, so
# version bumps could silently mis-describe the linked-against libs).
#
# Ordering invariant: `ldc2 -run build.d --backend=quickjs` MUST run
# before `dub build`, otherwise dub will warn about the missing
# import path. Same flow already documented in README / CLAUDE.md.

src/
build/
include/
*.tar.gz
